1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,520
Imagine designing the most important recorder on an airplane…

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,740
And then painting it bright orange.

3
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,943
Because that's exactly what engineers did.

4
00:00:08,293 --> 00:00:11,193
You see, this little device records crucial flight data

5
00:00:11,193 --> 00:00:13,743
and cockpit conversations.

6
00:00:13,743 --> 00:00:17,291
And if a plane crashes, investigators need to find it.

7
00:00:17,641 --> 00:00:18,891
But there's one problem.

8
00:00:18,891 --> 00:00:20,941
Everyone calls it the black box.

9
00:00:20,941 --> 00:00:23,401
So you'd expect it to be black, right?

10
00:00:23,401 --> 00:00:25,744
Well, that would be a terrible idea.

11
00:00:26,094 --> 00:00:27,284
After a crash,

12
00:00:27,284 --> 00:00:29,674
the recorder could end up buried in wreckage,

13
00:00:29,674 --> 00:00:31,044
hidden in forests,

14
00:00:31,044 --> 00:00:32,782
or lying deep underwater.

15
00:00:33,132 --> 00:00:35,442
And a black box in all that darkness?

16
00:00:35,442 --> 00:00:36,722
Good luck finding it.

17
00:00:36,722 --> 00:00:40,072
So engineers chose a completely different colour.

18
00:00:40,072 --> 00:00:42,466
Bright, highly visible orange.

19
00:00:42,816 --> 00:00:46,676
They also added reflective markings to help search teams spot it,

20
00:00:46,676 --> 00:00:50,363
and underwater locator beacons to help find it beneath the sea.

21
00:00:50,713 --> 00:00:52,323
And here's the funny part…

22
00:00:52,323 --> 00:00:54,933
The device everyone calls a black box

23
00:00:54,933 --> 00:00:57,493
is actually designed to stand out like a traffic cone.

24
00:00:57,843 --> 00:00:59,873
Because when an airplane disappears,

25
00:00:59,873 --> 00:01:01,933
the last thing investigators need…

26
00:01:01,933 --> 00:01:04,019
is a recorder that's good at hiding.
